EDWORD.THS - the EdWord thesaurus

EDWORD.THS is made from Open English WordNet (https://en-word.net/,
https://github.com/globalwordnet/english-wordnet) by tools/mkthes.py. It
keeps the synonym sets (synsets), their parts of speech and the words in
them, for headwords in EdWord's word list; the glosses and the other
relations are left out.

